  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "製圖學",
    "sub_ename": "CARTOGRAPHY",
    "describe_ch": "空間分析相關課程之基礎。課程的主要目標在於向學生介紹製圖藝術與製圖科學之內涵。包含對平面設計元素與專題製圖之介紹;一般和專題製圖;二維與三維製圖與呈現; 以及結合幾何空間與屬性之地圖描繪。另因數位製圖與其背後之電腦程式設計概念為現代結構化製圖之新方法，故本課程亦搭配電腦與軟體進行主題討論。完成本課程的學生將能夠更深入地解讀一般圖資與專題圖資，擁有有效結合地理資訊並將其有效展示之能力，亦能掌握議題進行專題製圖。",
    "describe_eh": "This course is a foundation for other courses on the analytical use of spatial information. This course provides an introduction to the art and science of cartography. It introduces the elements of graphic design, particularly as applied to thematic mapping. The survey includes general and thematic mapping; two and three dimensional representation; the geometric and the attribute information portrayed with maps. The techniques of computer programming behind digital cartography provide a new method to handle the structure of cartographic information and are worth study. Therefore, it also uses computer and software technology to demonstrate the topics discussed. Students finishing this course should be able to read thematic and general maps with greater understanding of their messages. They should be able to assemble geographic information and choose an effective display. They should have a grasp of design issues in thematic cartography.",
    "pre_subname": "",
    "pre_sub_id3": null,
    "pre_sub_ename": "",
    "pre_describe": null,
    "pre_describe_en": null,
    "scr_credit": 3.0
  },
  "targets": [
    {
      "seq": 1,
      "describe_ch": "應用製圖學於都市計劃",
      "describe_en": "Complete the course with a good understanding of how cartography is practiced in urban planning.\r\n"
    },
    {
      "seq": 2,
      "describe_ch": "獲得良好的地圖製作與地圖解讀技巧",
      "describe_en": "Demonstrate good map making and reading skills"
    }
